      "width": 2800,
      "height": 1690,
      "alt": "Three diffusion-based video compression paradigms: frame-wise image LDM, clip-wise latent video DiT, and SGVC with causal K/V propagation and direct pixel output.",
      "caption": "(a) Frame-wise image diffusion with recurrent conditioning. (b) Clip-wise latent video DiT with multi-frame buffering and VAE decoding. (c) SGVC adapts the video prior for causal frame-by-frame pixel reconstruction."
    },
